/mjx-mtable></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.8em 0.3em\"><mtr><mtd><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⇒</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mtext>d</mtext><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mtext>d</mtext><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mo>,</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mtext>d</mtext><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mtext>d</mtext><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>x</mi></mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace></mstyle></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⇒</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace></mstyle><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∫</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>x</mi></mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>d</mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Then, using the formula of integration by parts, we get\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\